## Commit Strategy Reminders
- Each step should be a separate commit
- Use conventional commit format: `type(scope): description`
- Before refactoring: commit original code first
- Refactoring commits must include: "Refactoring with [AI Name]"
- Keep commits small and focused
- Test before committing
- **After each commit**: Update this plan file by marking completed items with `[x]` and adding ✅ to the commit line

## Testing Requirements
- Minimum 10 unit test cases per method
- Use Pytest
- Mock external dependencies (AWS, AI services, database)
- Separate unit tests from integration tests
- Achieve >80% test coverage

## Notes
- Follow Clean Architecture principles throughout
- Use dependency injection
- Keep business logic independent of frameworks
- Write self-documenting code
- Use type hints everywhere
- Follow PEP 8 conventions
